{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de55e111322ec210ffca3442c278b185b2b61b23b6a91227dfad8e4863b418f7", "ja": "（『階のスターエレメンツ』、スペシャル版の撮影が\n始まった。未来は久しぶりの演技に、張り切っている）", "zh": "（《阶梯的明星元素》特别版开始拍摄了。未来难得再次演戏，干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "2c189271d429eb6df19d180e5cc478c44fcb67250f630fc291b212a105a2cf6f", "ja": "「そ、それは、そうだけど……でも、マヤちゃんは\nアイドルだもん！　そんなことするはずが……」", "zh": "“话、话是这么说没错……可是，玛雅她是\n偶像啊！怎么可能会做出那种事……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1002_p", "source_sha256": "545f34c6a6e905ff078e2a85790be84012a09de9ce762ca48409591eb910f83b", "ja": "この声は……未来だな。\n今日は稽古は休みなのに、練習してるのか。", "zh": "这个声音是……未来啊。\n今天明明休息不用排练，她还在练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1003_p", "source_sha256": "98c617ac6d0c7ece4dc845904ed09d2c846b1503951d37ca80fc31802fb35243", "ja": "お疲れ様、未来。\nお芝居の稽古は、順調か？", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n话剧排练还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "d59947b0d957bc4b118446f0e273d3272478b378ff65846841d4956c0960521c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　順調かどうかは\nわからないですけど、バッチリですよ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！虽然不知道算不算顺利，但绝对没问题哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1005_p", "source_sha256": "63c509cb530a2a67e5708d9cbb32015abb806ea040a90d9cfdc07a3cd115e004", "ja": "はは、そうか。少し聞こえてきたけど、\n今の光駆の台詞とか、すごく良かったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。虽然只听到了一点，但刚才光驱的台词之类的，真的很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "7d672cee4a0c2eae401770775db867a8e2b702e41a5067cb422147e34ec1e0ed", "ja": "やった！　{$P$}さんに\n褒められちゃった～えへへ♪", "zh": "太好了！被{$P$}先生夸了～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4ce807a438eaec05b60061daa7260781814a9a52d912f051731f0dc4059f25e0", "ja": "昨日も一日中撮影だったのに、元気だな。\n次は、いよいよ詩花演じる御剣摩耶とのシーンだっけ。", "zh": "昨天拍了一整天，你还是这么精神啊。\n接下来，终于要拍诗花饰演的御剑摩耶的戏份了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd9245ca1a892bebcac82255583d2763e0cd923f5d7c06d5b9436bf6e2b79905", "ja": "そうなんですよ～！　詩花さんって、\nすっごく優しくって、可愛くって……。", "zh": "就是这样～！诗花小姐她呀，特别温柔，又特别可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "076a77c832167afcb437e46ec11485d1773d0e5470ca251afa305ed4effda891", "ja": "それなのに……撮影中は、\n詩花さんじゃなくて、マヤちゃんだったんです。", "zh": "可是……拍摄的时候，她不是诗花，而是玛雅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "477412edc7f32c058b6aae6057f5a1ba40ac3d117f79112fa12c36f8a9a4da50", "ja": "だから……私……。", "zh": "所以……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8de4104b0587a38a6198cf91d5b1e3da989c32cc12ee9a45f4ca0cd0047b460c", "ja": "未来？", "zh": "未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "601779f6c738bf3d1e8b3254e9b06b628a4ac552763655756014ffed3fa8e2d5", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん！　詩花さんは、\nマヤちゃんみたいに意地悪な人じゃないですよね！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生！詩花小姐不是像摩耶那样坏心眼的人，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1013_p", "source_sha256": "46207f029d1cb0688b77e464c841f76fbd3dfe7e7da84f3ec1f69d7827bfaf0c", "ja": "……大丈夫。\n詩花は摩耶と違って、優しい子だと思うよ。", "zh": "……没事的。\n诗花和摩耶不一样，是个温柔的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "d54a7d22a6e5858fb752d78c0f451ed2930df72560fb14dde27fb30f336c7c5d", "ja": "そうですよね！　絶対絶対、違いますよね！？\nは～、よかった～。", "zh": "就是嘛！绝对绝对不一样，对吧！？\n哈～太好了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "d5f530d56948f62b755f6b809c5184bc262792189f888bf140d07ffc93a33450", "ja": "詩花さんのお芝居、あんまり上手だから。\n私、なんだかわからなくなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "因为诗花小姐的演技实在太好了。我都开始有点搞不清楚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1016_p", "source_sha256": "37c2c7310274f42b1354b6d00a556fea409f0ba393454c8a28e718613095e9cd", "ja": "そうか。未来が不安になるくらい、\n詩花の演技は凄かったかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。诗花的演技或许厉害到让未来都感到不安了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1017_p", "source_sha256": "53155dab931e96553bb946ef4bb5306475b797d2daa03251379b945132c33d55", "ja": "未来は未来で、その不安を台詞に乗せられたんだ。\nさっきの台詞は、光駆そのものだったよ。", "zh": "未来也能将那份不安融入台词中。\n刚才的台词，简直就是光驱本人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "8a3987f3d16a4cb50c1a2fea40d55c8eb4db74fe8761b839e6aee770da90fb37", "ja": "{$P$}さん……それって、\n私が光駆に近づけた、ってことですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……也就是说，\n我成功接近光駆了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1019_p", "source_sha256": "94efd0200d21f9b0e6d87ad3e1ba7dfc0e3d50479a5af8a3991ec88521ef9d51", "ja": "そうだ。みんなと切磋琢磨した事で、\n光駆の気持ちがわかったんだ。良かったな。", "zh": "没错。正因为和大家一起切磋琢磨，我才明白了光駆的心情。太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "b66b4204b5b3a67aabe5a8427249fea8b5921d2305e199b4d66987ffc9ccdcdf", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "d73d1e5cebf20e58ef0a2596e6828b1df1499e199e2d32b29cfeb1b1855c2ad1", "ja": "私、みんなと、もっともーっとセッサタクマしますね！\nよーし、がんばるぞ～！", "zh": "我要和大家一起，更加更加地切磋琢磨哦！\n好——，加油啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0583_1022_p", "source_sha256": "01c25a43533dfbbfd8154a4cc6bd1b8a8349f47248e3044c9bcbc34a036393a1", "ja": "（未来は、役と一緒に成長している。今度の撮影、\n詩花だけでなく琴葉達も、未来の芝居に驚くだろうな）", "zh": "（未来正在和角色一起成长。下次拍摄时，不仅是诗花，琴叶她们也会对未来的演技感到惊讶吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
